  "[action] Wang Lung listens to his sons' talk.",
  "[action] eldest son and his wife and second son bow to Wang Lung",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We have come to see our old father and to ask his blessing. We are not like the men of the town. We have not bought lands or made money for ourselves. We have only made a little to eat and live on. We have not been able to do more.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now you are like the men of my house,\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and now eat and drink what I have in the old house.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung observes his sons' lack of ambition.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son talks about his plans.",
  "the eldest son: \"The eldest son talks about his plans for his wife and his sons.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We have not been able to do more.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung speaks to his sons.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and well, and I suppose you are not like other men!\"",
